    "prompt": "Edit the attached image of the approved character face. This is a highly constrained cleanup to prepare a 3D face albedo, NOT a redesign or re-illustration. Preserve the exact original two eyes, pupils, iris colors and reflection details, the exact upper eyelashes, eyebrow curvature, nose highlight, blush and tiny open mouth, at their exact current pixel locations. Do not make the eyes bigger, change their angle or shape, symmetrize them, or change expression. Remove ALL the hair/bangs/strands, ears, collar, clothing, flowers, and the black triangular outside areas. Remove the face contour line/chin outline too. Fill every removed area with seamless pale peach warm skin matching the central cheek. The entire square canvas must be continuous pale skin, so the only visible features are the ORIGINAL eyes/eyebrows/nose/blush/mouth copied as faithfully as possible. Keep their positions and proportions exactly as in input, including the slight difference in eye height. No newly invented detailed eyes. Reconstruct only the very small feature portions covered by strands if necessary. Increase clean detail while maintaining the same drawings. Clean warm subtle flat cel anime coloring, no realism, no chunky lines or added gradients. Original character has 5.5-6 head ratio, pale butter yellow/navy/warm-white costume but no costume visible in this technical texture. Save a square face texture with no other elements.\n",
